cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this list or its data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Free Telegram Proxy List: verified MTProto proxies"
abstract: >-
  Working public Telegram MTProto / MTProxy proxies (FakeTLS ee, secure dd and
  classic). Every published proxy relayed a real req_pq_multi request to a
  Telegram datacenter and returned a random nonce in every one of 3 rounds.
  Rebuilt about every 15 minutes on GitHub Actions.
authors:
